Package: hstex
Version: @VERSION@
Section: tex
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: texlive-latex-base
Maintainer: HSTeX maintainers <maintainers@hstex.invalid>
Description: independent, low-latency pdfTeX-compatible engine
 HSTeX supplies a native typesetting engine and a pdflatex-compatible
 command-line overlay. It reuses the locally installed TeX Live package and
 font trees through the public kpsewhich interface.
